    "type": "new architecture support",
    "problem": [
      {
        "text": "Gemma3 already exposed a vision component, but its constructor was unfinished and its load/unload methods raised NotImplementedError. This change replaces that stub with image preprocessing, a vision tower and language-space embedding production.",
        "basis": "source",
        "evidence": [
          "call_e33d4e849d3d47cebe447df61f21d1ce",
          "call_548584d10c9a4ef88e1549ac8513de44"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "reasoning": [
      {
        "text": "The implementation composes existing modules rather than adding a separate execution engine. Configuration supplies their dimensions; preprocessing supplies half-precision image inputs; pooling reduces patch sequences before projection into the text model's hidden width.",
        "basis": "source",
        "evidence": [
          "call_548584d10c9a4ef88e1549ac8513de44",
          "call_10e645ef0d604682820fdc3a931f8b97"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "impact": [
      {
        "text": "The vision component gains image_input capability and get_image_embeddings, returning an MMEmbedding containing CPU vectors, image-boundary tokens, an alias and size metadata. The text-only Gemma3TextModel is relocated without changing its prefix-free construction.",
        "basis": "source",
        "evidence": [
          "call_548584d10c9a4ef88e1549ac8513de44",
          "call_40dca287017b4fcf979309ddf839766b"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "source_notes": [
